WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.040
Good morning, Hank. It's Friday August 29th

00:00:02.040 --> 00:00:04.020
and since I know you don't like to watch the news,

00:00:04.020 --> 00:00:07.020
I'm now going to tell you everything that I think you need to know about

00:00:07.020 --> 00:00:10.100
presumptive Republican vice presidential nominee, Sarah Palin

00:00:10.100 --> 00:00:13.200
Pahlin? I don't even know how to say her name I'm so surprised.

00:00:13.200 --> 00:00:19.900
[Vlogbrothers theme]

00:00:19.900 --> 00:00:24.300
Part 1: Sarah Palin is the 44-year-old governor of the great state of Alaska.

00:00:24.300 --> 00:00:27.460
She's been the governor of Alaska for just under 2 years.

00:00:27.460 --> 00:00:31.460
Before that she was the head of the city council in Wasilla, Alaska...

00:00:31.480 --> 00:00:34.900
A town name I might be mispronouncing even though I've been there several times.

00:00:34.900 --> 00:00:38.600
Number 2: On all of the social issues that are important to the Republican base

00:00:38.600 --> 00:00:40.400
she is reliably conservative.

00:00:40.400 --> 00:00:43.500
She's strongly pro-life, anti-gay marriage, and a life-long member of the

00:00:43.500 --> 00:00:45.100
National Rifle Association

00:00:45.160 --> 00:00:46.900
In fact, she is a moose hunter.

00:00:46.900 --> 00:00:48.900
That sounds like a euphemism for something, but it's not

00:00:48.900 --> 00:00:50.160
She actually hunts moose.

00:00:50.160 --> 00:00:54.100
Number 3: In what might be the most politically corrupt state in the U.S.

00:00:54.100 --> 00:00:57.680
She has a reputation for being strongly anti-corruption.

00:00:57.680 --> 00:00:59.800
Hank, I briefly lived in Alaska and let me tell you from

00:00:59.800 --> 00:01:01.701
experience Alaska has about as many

00:01:01.730 --> 00:01:04.890
uncorrupt politicians as it has
pleasant winter days

00:01:04.890 --> 00:01:08.070
so that's certainly a vote in her
favor. Another vote in her favor would be

00:01:08.070 --> 00:01:10.869
thing 4. She's married to a
commercial fisherman

00:01:10.869 --> 00:01:13.960
now, Hank, I wasn't able to find any
pictures of Sarah Palin's husband on

00:01:13.960 --> 00:01:17.939
the internet but I'm hoping that he
looks like the sailor from The Simpsons.

00:01:17.939 --> 00:01:22.020
Thing 5: She has a kid named Track.
That's a political liability.

00:01:22.020 --> 00:01:26.360
Who's joined the Army and is going to Iraq. That's a political asset.

00:01:26.360 --> 00:01:30.979
It's like McCain was saying, "Joe Biden I
see your son who's going to Iraq and I

00:01:30.979 --> 00:01:34.460
raise you an Alaskan infantryman named
Track."

00:01:34.460 --> 00:01:38.020
Oh, also, I forgot to mention Sarah
Palin's husband is a semi-professional

00:01:38.020 --> 00:01:39.080
snowmobiler

00:01:40.940 --> 00:01:43.160
Really. He races snowmobiles.

00:01:43.170 --> 00:01:47.380
Thing 6: She has absolutely no foreign
policy experience.

00:01:47.380 --> 00:01:50.159
Now, of course, the McCain camp's going to say
that it doesn't matter that she doesn't

00:01:50.159 --> 00:01:53.229
have foreign policy experience because
McCain has loads of foreign policy

00:01:53.229 --> 00:01:54.350
experience.

00:01:54.350 --> 00:01:57.450
Which is fine. Just so long as McCain is

00:01:57.450 --> 00:02:01.850
you know, alive. Which I thought was kinda
why you picked a vice president but

00:02:01.850 --> 00:02:02.430
anyway.

00:02:02.430 --> 00:02:05.780
Thing 7: She's been a very Alaska-centric governor.

00:02:05.780 --> 00:02:08.709
You know there's some governors like say
Kathleen Sebelius or Rod Blagojevich who

00:02:08.709 --> 00:02:11.709
end up kinda leading on certain
national issues.

00:02:11.709 --> 00:02:14.760
She hasn't been like that. She's all
Alaska, all the time.

00:02:14.760 --> 00:02:17.910
I mean you could argue that her energy
policy has been influential outside

00:02:17.910 --> 00:02:19.610
of Alaska in some ways, but

00:02:19.610 --> 00:02:22.780
I'm not convinced. Although she is very
popular in Alaska.

00:02:22.780 --> 00:02:25.620
Nerdfighters, particularly Republican nerdfighters, I'm interested to know what you

00:02:25.620 --> 00:02:27.739
think about the Palin pick. Let me know in comments.

00:02:27.739 --> 00:02:31.439
Hank, don't forget to be awesome, and as
always best wishes!

00:02:33.660 --> 00:02:37.020
Oh! and, Hank, the nerdfighters finished the second
part of the scavenger hunt. I already did one

00:02:37.030 --> 00:02:41.440
live blog TV show, but I'm gonna do another
one today at 3:30 p.m, Eastern.

00:02:41.440 --> 00:02:42.000
Link in the sidebar.

